Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.80,H_fil,,0,0,0,,Nawalan ng lahat ang tagapagmana... ngayon nagmakaawa na siya
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.80,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Tigilan mo na 'yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:03.50,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ang buong 28th floor kay Shen Xiujin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:05.38,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Walang key card, hindi ka makakaakyat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:10.68,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Jian Tong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.12,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Miss Jian.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:15.85,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Binuksan mo talaga ang mata ko ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:17.13,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ang dating Miss Jian,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.69,0:00:18.81,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ngayon para lang makamakaawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.25,S_fil,,0,0,0,,lumuhod sa harap ng lahat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:22.33,S_fil,,0,0,0,,at yayakapin ang isang katulong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.69,0:00:24.19,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.89,0:00:26.93,S_fil,,0,0,0,,kapag nalaman ni lolo Jian Zhendong,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.87,0:00:29.23,S_fil,,0,0,0,,hindi ba't hiyang-hiya siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:30.78,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Walang Jian Tong sa pamilyang Jian.
